  "When the app opens and every few hours. Only new features (like 1.2.0 or 2.0.0) are announced with a window; small fixes (like 1.2.3) wait here. StellarHub always asks before updating.": "在打开应用时以及每隔几小时检查一次。只有新功能（如 1.2.0 或 2.0.0）会弹窗提示；小修复（如 1.2.3）会在这里等待。StellarHub 在更新前总会征得你的同意。",
  "StellarHub needs the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime, and this PC doesn't have it. Download it from Microsoft now?": "StellarHub 需要 Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime，而这台电脑没有安装。现在从 Microsoft 下载吗？",
  "Getting to know your PC. The first start takes a little longer.": "正在了解你的电脑。首次启动会稍慢一些。",
  "Almost there…": "马上就好…"
}
